  "aboutSport": {
    "paragraph1": {
      "en": "The Mahatma Phule Krishi Vidyapeeth Rahuri was established in the year 1969 on the cordial Principle of integrating teaching, research and extension in Agricultural Sciences. The University presently has 09 constituent colleges and 63 affiliated colleges (Private colleges) imparting education for graduate and post graduates students in Agriculture, Horticulture, Agril. Engineering, Agril. Business Management, Agril Biotechnology, Food Science and Technology with an over all strength of 5574 students during the year 2018-19.",
